filippi1 the Slayer ascended to demigod-hood at level 23 with 516 hp
and 3085000 points.

Spoilers follow:

(darn, did that control-L get in there?  Don't think so.)

      This, though my first victory, was perhaps THE most frustrating game
of nethack I have ever played.  Never having reached the castle before, I 
was pleasantly surprised to discover a wand of wishing in one of its little
alcoves.  With the wand of polymorph thus obtained, I was able to obtain
darn near everything the well-dressed barbarian ever wanted... with 2 wishes
still left!
      So, I wander out into the castle foyer with my ring of conflict on, 
and the following meets my eyes:

"The gelatinous cube misses Niels."
"Niels hits the gelatinous cube!"
"Suddenly, the gelatinous cube disappears out of sight."

Nifty, I think.. until I hear a "slurping sound."

Of course, the gelatinous cube proceeds to digest my ENTIRE polypile as well
as the wand of wishing, the two blessed bags of holding, etc, etc, etc...
ARRRRR.  And, having put my polypile on the CASTLE level, I was unable to
teleport over to it in anywhere near the kind of time it would have taken
to prevent this heinous event.

I won anyway... and got out with 90 gems to boot, too!

After 18 months it's about time.

